# The connectors this checkout actually runs.
#
# Every name here is a spec with `status: connected`, which means: it generates
# an unpaused ingest DAG on any stack that comes up, and it demands the variable
# in its `token_env` on every clone. That is a deliberate choice per connector,
# so it is written down twice — once in the spec, once here — and `ingest
# validate` fails if the two disagree.
#
# One name per line, sorted. Two connector pull requests then append different
# lines and merge cleanly; the list used to be a Python literal inside a test,
# where every connector rewrote the same line.
#
# Delete a line and the spec keeps its history but stops being ours to run.
# A fork that is not us should empty this file and set every status to
# `reference` — the stack then schedules nothing.

customerio
swoogo
